# Pairs with ReadPositionHonest. The born flag outlives the activation that bound
# the tree id, so a reactivated leaf live-advances over entries an earlier
# activation appended and its replay has not read yet.
MODULE: ReadPositionHonestStopKeepsBirth
TARGET: ReadPositionHonest
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a stopped leaf keeps its born flag into its next activation
PERTURBS: LeafStop

--- FIND
    /\ UNCHANGED pinVars
    /\ own' = [own EXCEPT ![l] = {}]
    /\ poison' = [poison EXCEPT ![l] = FALSE]
    /\ born' = [born EXCEPT ![l] = FALSE]
--- REPLACE
    /\ UNCHANGED pinVars
    /\ own' = [own EXCEPT ![l] = {}]
    /\ poison' = [poison EXCEPT ![l] = FALSE]
\* MUTATION: the stop keeps the birth.
    /\ UNCHANGED born
--- END
